  "result": "The board now excludes archived issues. The cause was in `listBoardColumns` in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts`. Its query filtered by org and project but never added the `archived_at IS NULL` predicate. The issue list, counts, and exports all apply `livePredicate`, so they were unaffected.\n\nThe fix adds `livePredicate(issues.archivedAt, {})` to that query's `compact(...)` filter list. With an empty scope, the helper emits `isNull(archivedAt)`. I haven't run the test suite.",
